OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FARCHIVE: The TV Room
OL,8,FThe cuts to BBC Two trade test
OL,9,Ftransmissions in January 1975 were
OL,10,Fmotivated in part by the need to save
OL,11,Fenergy.
OL,13,FThe impact on the public was minimal
OL,14,Falthough the trade suffered
OL,15,Finconvenience.
OL,17,FBut a year earlier, a national
OL,18,Femergency led to much more serious cuts
OL,19,Fto broadcasting.
OL,23,APub: 20-Jan-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
