OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe row over the early closedowns was
OL,7,Fexplored in an article in The Stage `
OL,8,Fthe newspaper of the entertainment
OL,9,Findustry ` in January 1974.
OL,11,FThe power saving directly involved
OL,12,Fseemed modest.
OL,14,FDid the cut have more to do with
OL,15,Fsending the nation to bed early `
OL,16,Fturning off lights and fires as well as
OL,17,Ftelevision sets?
OL,19,FThe obvious point was made: why not go
OL,20,Ffor a daytime shutdown instead?
OL,23,APub: 20-Jan-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
