OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt would be interesting to know if
OL,7,Fconsideration was given to an enforced
OL,8,Fdaytime closedown.
OL,10,FNothing before lunchtime and from 2pm `
OL,11,F4pm?
OL,13,FOther services deemed essential to
OL,14,Fnational life were exempted from the
OL,15,Fmajor power restrictions and the Three
OL,16,FDay Week.
OL,18,FThese included newspapers and radio
OL,19,Fbroadcasters.
OL,23,APub: 20-Jan-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
