OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FYet even in 1973, some did not seem to
OL,7,Fconsider television essential in the
OL,8,Fsame way.
OL,10,FApparently Prime Minister Ted Heath did
OL,11,Fnot have a set.
OL,13,FNot surprisingly, this restriction was
OL,14,Fvery unpopular with the public as well
OL,15,Fas the broadcasters.
OL,23,APub: 20-Jan-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
