OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F129A1768760743
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G8/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe election campaign in February 1974
OL,7,Fled to it being lifted. This was
OL,8,Fsupposedly to ensure election
OL,9,Fbroadcasting was not curtailed. It
OL,10,Fsounds suspiciously like a handy cover
OL,11,Fstory.
OL,13,FThe BBC kept on with its voluntary
OL,14,Frestrictions on BBC Two power until the
OL,15,FThree Day Week ended after Labour's
OL,16,Felection victory.
OL,18,FSo after such genuine hardship, it's
OL,19,Fhardly surprising that cuts to BBC
OL,20,FTwo's trade tests were reimposed a year
OL,21,Flater by a cash-strapped corporation.
OL,23,APub: 20-Jan-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
